<span class=\"ps-meta\"><span class=\"t\">地铁通勤</span><br><span class=\"d\">交通出行</span></span>\n            <span class=\"ps-amt minus\">-6.00</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ps-bars\">\n            <span style=\"height:35%\"></span>\n            <span style=\"height:55%\"></span>\n            <span class=\"hi\" style=\"height:90%\"></span>\n            <span style=\"height:48%\"></span>\n            <span style=\"height:66%\"></span>\n            <span style=\"height:40%\"></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ================= 区块 2：功能特性 ================= -->\n<section class=\"features\" data-oey-section=\"features\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <span class=\"sec-tag\" data-oey-object=\"features.tag\">核心功能</span>\n      <h2 data-oey-object=\"features.title\">简单三步，掌控你的财务生活</h2>\n      <p data-oey-object=\"features.subtitle\">不需要财务知识，也不需要复杂表格。简账把记账、分析、储蓄做成了一件毫不费力的小事。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feat-grid\">\n      <div class=\"feat-card\">\n        <div class=\"feat-ico f1\" data-oey-object=\"features.card1-icon\">⚡</div>\n        <h3 data-oey-object=\"features.card1-title\">3 秒极速记账</h3>\n        <p data-oey-object=\"features.card1-text\">下拉即记、语音输入、账单截图识别，常用分类一键完成。每天坚持记账，原来可以这么轻松。</p>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"feat-link\" data-oey-object=\"features.card1-link\">了解记账方式 →</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feat-card\">\n        <div class=\"feat-ico f2\" data-oey-object=\"features.card2-icon\">📊</div>\n        <h3 data-oey-object=\"features.card2-title\">智能收支报表</h3>\n        <p data-oey-object=\"features.card2-text\">周报、月报、年报自动生成，消费结构一目了然。哪笔钱花得不值，图表替你说清楚。</p>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"feat-link\" data-oey-object=\"features.card2-link\">查看报表示例 →</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feat-card\">\n        <div class=\"feat-ico f3\" data-oey-object=\"features.card3-icon\">🎯</div>\n        <h3 data-oey-object=\"features.card3-title\">预算与储蓄目标</h3>\